    "Claude Island needs Accessibility permission to:\n\n• Monitor mouse position to show/hide the notch\n• Pass clicks through to apps behind the notch\n\nTo grant permission:\n1. Click \"Open Settings\" below\n2. Click the \"+\" button at the bottom of the list\n3. Navigate to and select the Claude Island app bundle\n4. Enable the checkbox next to Claude Island\n\nImportant: If Claude Island is already in the list but not working, remove it first using the \"-\" button, then add it again using \"+\".": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Island needs Accessibility permission to:\n\n• Monitor mouse position to show/hide the notch\n• Pass clicks through to apps behind the notch\n\nTo grant permission:\n1. Click \"Open Settings\" below\n2. Click the \"+\" button at the bottom of the list\n3. Navigate to and select the Claude Island app bundle\n4. Enable the checkbox next to Claude Island\n\nImportant: If Claude Island is already in the list but not working, remove it first using the \"-\" button, then add it again using \"+\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Island 需要辅助功能权限，以便：\n\n• 监测鼠标位置来显示或隐藏刘海\n• 将点击事件透传给刘海后方的应用\n\n授予权限的方法：\n1. 点击下方“打开设置”\n2. 点击列表底部的“+”按钮\n3. 找到并选择 Claude Island 应用\n4. 打开 Claude Island 旁边的开关\n\n重要提示：如果 Claude Island 已经在列表中但仍无法正常工作，请先用“-”按钮将其移除，再用“+”重新添加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Island 需要輔助使用權限，以便：\n\n• 監測滑鼠位置來顯示或隱藏劉海\n• 將點擊事件傳遞給劉海後方的應用程式\n\n授予權限的方法：\n1. 點一下下方的「打開設定」\n2. 點一下列表底部的「+」按鈕\n3. 找到並選取 Claude Island 應用程式\n4. 打開 Claude Island 旁邊的開關\n\n重要提示：如果 Claude Island 已經在列表中但仍無法正常運作，請先用「-」按鈕將其移除，再用「+」重新加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
